{"ticker":"DELL","updated":"2026-11-20T22:49:07Z","profile":{"longName":"Dell Technologies Inc.","shortName":"Dell Technologies Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Computer Hardware","country":"United States","website":"https://www.dell.com","fullTimeEmployees":97000,"marketCap":176768647168,"trailingPE":16.163952,"forwardPE":9.100967,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.169128,"pegRatio":0.32,"targetMeanPrice":578.88,"targetHighPrice":700.0,"targetLowPrice":403.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":25,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.577,"earningsGrowth":2.729,"grossMargins":0.19910999,"operatingMargins":0.09904,"profitMargins":0.07525,"totalRevenue":151197007872,"beta":1.436,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":595.51,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":110.22,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.81},"summary":"Dell Technologies Inc. designs, develops, manufactures, markets, sells, and supports various comprehensive and integrated solutions, products, and services in the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Asia, and internationally. The company operates through Infrastructure Solutions Group (ISG) and Client Solutions Group (CSG) segments. The ISG segment provides modern and traditional storage solutions, including all-flash, purpose-built, hyper-converged infrastructure, software-defined storage, and general-purpose and AI-optimized servers. This segment also offers networking products and services comprising wide area network infrastructure, data center and edge networking switches, and cables and optics that help its business customers to transform and modernize their infrastructure and complementing its server and storage solutions; and software, peripherals, and services, including consulting and support, and deployment. The CSG segment provides notebooks, desktops, and workstations and branded peripherals that include displays, docking stations, keyboards, mice, webcam and audio devices, and third-party software and peripherals; and configuration, and extended warranties services. The company is involved in originating, collecting, and servicing customer financing arrangements and offers payment and consumption solutions and services, such utility, subscription, as-a-service, lea","summary_zh":"Dell Technologies Inc. 在美洲、歐洲、中東、亞洲和國際範圍內設計、開發、製造、行銷、銷售和支援各種全面的整合解決方案、產品和服務。該公司透過基礎設施解決方案集團（ISG）和客戶解決方案集團（CSG）部門進行營運。 ISG部門提供現代化和傳統儲存解決方案，包括全快閃、專用、超融合基礎架構、軟體定義儲存以及通用和人工智慧最佳化的伺服器。該部門還提供網路產品和服務，包括廣域網路基礎設施、資料中心和邊緣網路交換器以及電纜和光纖，幫助其企業客戶改造和現代化其基礎設施，並補充其伺服器和儲存解決方案；軟體、週邊設備和服務，包括諮詢和支援以及部署。 CSG部門提供筆記型電腦、桌上型電腦和工作站以及品牌週邊設備，包括顯示器、擴充座、鍵盤、滑鼠、網路攝影機和音訊設備以及第三方軟體和周邊設備；和配置以及延長保固服務。該公司參與發起、收集和服務客戶融資安排，並提供支付和消費解決方案和服務，例如公用事業、訂閱、即服務、租賃","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"電腦硬體","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":132.62,"h":137.98,"l":131.81,"c":135.69,"v":10255200},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":136.08,"h":137.35,"l":133.25,"c":134.34,"v":4750800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":135.0,"h":135.5,"l":131.72,"c":132.09,"v":3921900},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":129.38,"h":131.26,"l":127.12,"c":130.96,"v":4758900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":128.01,"h":131.11,"l":127.6,"c":130.76,"v":3841000},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":132.13,"h":134.59,"l":132.13,"c":133.9,"v":3833400},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":134.0,"h":141.77,"l":134.0,"c":141.77,"v":9934600},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":140.91,"h":149.68,"l":140.4,"c":149.68,"v":13612000},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":150.49,"h":152.1,"l":144.61,"c":147.37,"v":7490800},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":148.26,"h":149.2,"l":140.41,"c":140.74,"v":6526700},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":145.52,"h":149.28,"l":144.26,"c":145.76,"v":10454700},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":152.8,"h":154.7,"l":144.4,"c":150.87,"v":18683200},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":154.71,"h":166.1,"l":154.0,"c":164.53,"v":18937900},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":164.32,"h":164.94,"l":155.15,"c":155.95,"v":13275600},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":157.57,"h":159.28,"l":150.42,"c":150.57,"v":11749100},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":155.55,"h":155.55,"l":151.11,"c":153.4,"v":6800900},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":149.98,"h":152.56,"l":148.1,"c":148.77,"v":7096400},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":152.